A||||4||mrtgman||Are these noses interchangeable?||||1||
Z||000000||mrtgman||10-17-2001||11:00 PM||||Is the nose on an 85 GT the exact same as the nose on an 86 GT?<P>Thanks for the input!<P>------------------<BR> 86 gt owned since new!<A HREF="http://www.palmbeachloan.com" TARGET=_blank>http://www.palmbeachloan.com</A>||||reg||1
Z||000001||Old Lar||10-17-2001||11:08 PM||||Yes and No.  Exact same is too specific. The 86 aero nose will fit the 85 aero nose. Most body components for Fieros will fit all years.  However there are exceptions like deck lids are different.||||reg||1
Z||000002||mrtgman||10-17-2001||11:14 PM|||| <BLOCKQUOTE><font size="1" face="Verdana, Arial, Helvetica">quote:</font><HR>Originally posted by Old Lar:<BR><B>Yes and No.  Exact same is too specific. The 86 aero nose will fit the 85 aero nose. Most body components for Fieros will fit all years.  However there are exceptions like deck lids are different.</B><HR></BLOCKQUOTE><P><BR>will an 85 nose fit an 86 nose? are they the same look? <BR>||||reg||1
Z||000003||sqoach||10-17-2001||11:16 PM||||Yes, they all fit the same. The difference in the 85 GT nose and the 86 GT nose is that the 85 had the ribbed molding and the 86 had smooth. Other than that, they look identical.<P>------------------<BR>-Adam<BR><FONT COLOR="BLUE">sqoach@yahoo.com</FONT><BR>              <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/sqoach.gif">             <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/fullstaff.gif">              <BR>^^^^^<B>new project</B>^^^^^<BR><FONT SIZE="1"><LI>86 SC 2.5L 5spd</FONT>||||reg||1
Z||000004||Fiero5||10-17-2001||11:34 PM||||When I put together my 86SS, I had to use the nose and rear bumper from an 85GT, as the side molding on my 86 coupe was ribbed. I could have gone and changed all the side molding to smooth to allow me to use the 86 and up GT nose and bumper, but luckily I was able to get the 85GT ones in the red color I needed from Bob Parker at Kick Hill Farms.<P>You can mix and match body panels all you want, as that is just one of the many great things about Fieros.<P>Have fun.<P>Steve<P>------------------<BR>                                 <IMG SRC="http://a1040.g.akamai.net/f/1040/759/1h/206.29.192.139/info/pics/sept11.jpg">                              <BR>http://kelleyfamilyfieros.50megs.com||||reg||6
